    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>You see which parts of the page are lying.</em></p><p>You have <strong>advantage</strong> on <strong>Occult (Mind)</strong>, <strong>Faith (Soul)</strong>, and <strong>Investigation (Mind)</strong> checks made to analyze:</p><ul><li>Occult texts, grimoires, and sephirothic diagrams</li><li>Spark-related artifacts or devices</li><li>Glyphs, wards, and Qliphothic sigils</li></ul><p>In addition, when you spend at least <strong>10 minutes</strong> studying such a subject, the GM should offer you at least one <strong>solid, non-misleading clue</strong> about its Lore, function, or risk, even on a low roll, unless the truth is explicitly warded or hidden by higher powers.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wlTruthEye\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Researcher's Eye</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> Passive + 10-min study &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Passive / Downtime &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Reroll the lowest die on Occult (Mind), Faith (Soul), and Investigation (Mind) checks analyzing occult texts, Spark artifacts, glyphs/wards/Qliphothic sigils. After 10 min of study, GM owes at least one solid clue even on a low roll.</div>\n</div>",
